00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:42.910
you are making?

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:45.010
What failure modes
are you worried about?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:48.140
What bottlenecks are
you worried about?

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.270
Now, I know most
