00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.510
because as an
industry, we have done

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:56.450
an effective job
in disseminating

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.250
scalability patterns.

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:00.470
And thanks to cloud,
