00:32:37.240 --> 00:32:38.520
This will hold the key.

00:32:38.520 --> 00:32:41.576
And I'll select a
Location of us-central1.

00:32:41.576 --> 00:32:42.920
Click Create.

00:32:42.920 --> 00:32:44.500
Next, I'll create the key.

00:32:44.500 --> 00:32:49.870
Similar name--
"support-team-key."

00:32:49.870 --> 00:32:52.840
And the rotation period is how
