00:45:04.330 --> 00:45:08.430
So this is a large semiconductor
manufacturer right here,

00:45:08.430 --> 00:45:10.560
actually, in the Bay Area.

00:45:10.560 --> 00:45:14.380
And their use case
is broadly twofold.

00:45:14.380 --> 00:45:19.740
One is, they continue to have
more of a hybrid environment--

00:45:19.740 --> 00:45:23.940
some on premise, as well
as new workloads in GCP.

00:45:23.940 --> 00:45:27.060
And they're looking
for a data protection

00:45:27.060 --> 00:45:33.630
offering that can do both
while also leveraging GCS.

00:45:33.630 --> 00:45:37.140
So what they started off
with is, deploy the Cohesity

00:45:37.140 --> 00:45:39.720
